The [[Ruby Egg]] is a legendary [[Pet]] available in the shop for all classes. It doesn't do a whole lot for its size, granting the player 4 {{icon/heat}} at start of battle and reflecting 3 debuffs. The true purpose of the egg, however, is that it hatches into the [[Ruby Whelp]], which is a powerful [[Weapon]] [[Pet]].

The [[Pyromancer]] subclass item, [[Dragon Nest]], allows the [[Ruby Egg]] and other dragon eggs to hatch in a single round, as long as they are in the {{icon/star}} slots.
